SUMMARY:IJCNLP 2026 · ARR paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Asia-Pacific ACL and International Joint Conference on Natural 
 Language Processing\nMeeting: 2026-11-06 to 2026-11-10\, Hengqin\, China\
 nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-07\nFormat: Paper-based\nOfficial so
 urce: https://2026.aaclnet.org/calls/main_conference_papers/\nVenue Radar
 : https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ijcnlp-2026\nNotes: Joint AACL-I
 JCNLP 2026 is one edition under the IJCNLP series\, not two conferences. 
